      "description": "Download the Student Beans app and unlock hundreds of exclusive student discounts handpicked for you. \n\n#1 RATED STUDENT DISCOUNT APP\n\nExclusive discounts to make student life a little sweeter and a lot cheaper. \n\nStudent Beans is the top-rated money-saving app for students. We’ve got exclusive discounts you can't find anywhere else and more offers than any other app.\n\n\nWE MAKE SAVING MONEY EASY\n\nIt’s FREE for all uni, college & 6th form students\nSign up and verify  as a student in just seconds\nAccess the widest range of offers and brands anywhere\nGrab a discount code and save money on your shopping!\n\nGet a personalised experience by turning on push notifications and find out about the recommended offers that are right for you.\n\n\nMORE BRANDS & MORE DISCOUNTS\n\n- Get exclusive discount codes available only on our app\n\n- Over 1,000 brands and +750 exclusive offers you can’t find anywhere else\n\n- New brands added every week\n\n- Regular “boosted” discounts. You can get up to 70% off!\n\nHere’s a short list of some of the brands that you could save money with:\n\nMcDonald’s, ASOS, GymShark, Amazon Prime, PrettyLittleThing, UberEats, MissGuided, KFC, Boohoo, Apple, ee, NastyGal, Schuh, Lenovo, Alton Towers, Pandora, Gregg’s\n\n...and 100s more available on the app!\n\n\nONLINE & IN-STORE\n\nONLINE - Just copy the discount code and add it to your shopping. Our codes work every time, so you won’t miss out on any savings.\n\nIN-STORE - All you need to do when you get to the cashier's desk is flash your digital student iD on your phone and you'll get the discount applied in-store, at the restaurant or for any other kind of service.\n\nThe Student Beans iD proves your student status, so you won't need a physical student card again. It's that simple!\n\n\nAN ESSENTIAL APP FOR STUDENT LIFE\n\nEvery student should take advantage of all the amazing free student discounts and promo codes that Student Beans offers. Getting our app is a 